          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Estimated Lookback Time</span>
          <div class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" id="astro-lookback">
            10.42 Billion Years
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono" id="astro-age">
            Universe was ~3.38 Gyr old at emission
          </div>
